  "body": "<b>Investigate</b> (<wil>). When this test begins, name a chaos token. Reveal 3 chaos tokens instead of 1. Choose 1 to resolve and ignore the others. If the chosen token matches the named token, and the test is successful, discover 2 additional clues at your location. For each non-⭐ symbol token revealed during this test, lose 1 resource.",
